# No spell is cast while a spell with split second is on the stack, by a resolving ability either (CR 702.61a, 608.2g,
# Krosan Grip's ruling). Spell Queller exiles Bot2's Lightning Bolt. Bot2 casts Krosan Grip at Bot1's Ashnod's Altar;
# in response Bot1 sacrifices the Queller to the Altar (a mana ability, which split second allows, CR 702.61b). Its
# leaves-the-battlefield ability resolves above the Grip: Bot2, the Bolt's owner, could not cast it, so is not asked (the
# refusal), and the Bolt stays in exile. (Asked and accepted without split second:
# spell-queller-exiles-an-opponents-bolt-whose-owner-casts-it-free-at-a-new-target-when-it-dies.)

